PDF GENERATION NOTE
===================
A true PDF binary could not be embedded through this channel because the
GitHub file-write API accepts text content only. This file is the
canonical text source for KCN_BTP001_Benchmark_Report.pdf.

To produce the PDF locally, run:

    python3 -c "import weasyprint; weasyprint.HTML('file:KCN_BTP001_Benchmark_Report.html').write_pdf('KCN_BTP001_Benchmark_Report.pdf')"

or open the HTML in a browser and choose Print -> Save as PDF.

All benchmark numbers, suite inventories, audit metrics, federation CI
history, and BTP-001 sign-off fields are identical to the HTML report.
